      <t indent="0" pn="section-8-1">IANA has allocated the following from the Standards Action <xref target="RFC8126" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC8126"/>
range of the &quot;RBridge Channel Protocols&quot; registry, which is part of
the &quot;Transparent Interconnection of Lots of Links (TRILL) Parameters&quot;
registry.</t>
